<title>USA: Robbins &amp; Myers gets $150 mln in credit.</title>
<headline>Robbins &amp; Myers gets $150 mln in credit.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, OHIO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robbins &amp; Myers Inc said it signed a $150 million unsecured bank credit agreement with a consortium of five banks.</p>
<p>The agreement provides the company with a $100 million revolving credit facility for five years, as well as $50 million in additional revolving credit.</p>
<p>The company said it used the credit to pay off $30 million of debt under prior credit agreements. It has $120 million of credit left under the agreement for future use, it added.</p>
</text>
